src:
So then! Seekseek has prepare reward
for bring Nopon Coins, so when ready,
give Seekseek shout!

In that case, maybe we should go and look
for him. If it looks like he's being reckless,
we'll bring him back. Sound good?

She'll give me a real dressing-down
if I don't, and I don't know about you,
but she scares me when she's angry.

A tree there is, Sophora is its name. And
from its leaves are fashioned certain things,
all worn upon the body in the rite.

Aye, tell ye the truth, we're all suckers
for that kind o' thing. You just wait,
old timer. We'll bring it back for you!

Well, whichever way he was or seemed,
if he's got a bone to pick with the City,
we gotta nip that in the bud.

You must've been begged to come here by
that pathetic coward of a guard captain;
tears pouring down her eyes an' all.

I was helping out the procurement squad
from Agnus. If you have any questions,
feel free to ask.

It's most likely a Levnis from the Castle, so
if you can access a terminal or something,
you might be able to learn a thing or two?

It wasn't easy for me, looking on
from the sidelines in my child's body,
while you did all the work.

ru:
А для этого нужно расширять кругозор;
впитывать новые виды, звуки
и запахи!

src:
I mean, you can't expect much of a challenge
from a bunch of soulless shells. Snuff me,
though. If the Consuls stooped any lower...

Come on, get to the central cell block
for morning assembly! You can't be late,
or you'll wind up in a punishment cell.

The guards know we wouldn't stand
for it if they laid a hand on Ghondor,
so they turn a blind eye to most stuff.

He said he was sorry for keeping it
from us. You guys are on the same level,
right? Maybe you can work together!

This based on blueprint Masterpon get
from some place or other. Currently,
reliability is not fully known.

If there are going to be a lot of people
from the outside coming into the City,
I'd love to hear all their stories!

ru:
Эта Основательница слыла умной и мудрой;
именно она заложила основы многих
законов и устройства власти Города.

src:
Lemme ask you, then. Did you choose
for yourself? You chose this life personally,
did you?

There are ways. Steal enough Levnises
from us, whittle away at Monica's support,
and soon she'd be wide open.

I'm definitely grateful to Rozana,
for that if nothing else, but yeah,
that's about the size of it...

Shouldn't we also look over our gems
while we're at it? They'll make us way,
way more awesome.

I would've liked to dispatch a survey team
if we'd had the manpower, but right now,
our focus is on restoring Lambda.

That'd just result in a deadlock. However,
if we hid our soldiers in Lambda's Ferronis,
we'd be able to cause some chaos at least...

When helping an incapacitated ally,
revives them with [ML:EnhanceParam paramtype=1 ]% more HP;
also raises Healing by [ML:EnhanceParam paramtype=2 ].

ru:
Помогая недееспособному союзнику,
оживляет его с запасом HP на [ML:EnhanceParam paramtype=1 ]% больше;
также повышает лечение на [ML:EnhanceParam paramtype=2 ].

src:
Grants a high Critical Rate;
also evades enemy attacks
while Art is active.

ru:
Даёт высокий шанс критического удара;
также уклоняется от атак врагов,
пока Искусство активно.

src:
Deals defense-bypassing damage;
also evades attacks while Art is
active.

ru:
Наносит урон, игнорирующий защиту;
также уклоняется от атак,
пока Искусство активно.

src:
When chosen, Mio gains TP equal to
100% of Hero's TP (maximum of 99;
only applied if Mio can still act).

ru:
При выборе Мио получает TP, равный
100% TP героя (максимум 99;
применяется, только если Мио ещё может действовать).

С ростом уровня персонажи смогут экипировать до трёх
самоцветов. Каждый самоцвет даёт уникальный эффект;
подбирайте их под роль и стиль боя!

src:
The Soulhacker class cannot set Master Arts and Skills;
instead, they possess a special ability that lets them acquire
Arts and skills by defeating unique monsters.
